      "data": {
        "value": "<div class=\"relative\">\n<div class=\"prose text-pretty dark:prose-invert inline leading-normal break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word]\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>SPECIMEN: PAP SMEAR - Liquid Based Cytology (LBC)</strong></p>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Clinical Notes -</strong><br><strong>Gross Examination:</strong> Specimen received in PreservCyt solution vial</p>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>MICROSCOPIC EXAMINATION</strong></p>\n<div class=\"group relative\">\n<div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto md:max-w-[90vw] border-borderMain/50 ring-borderMain/50 divide-borderMain/50 dark:divide-borderMainDark/50 dark:ring-borderMainDark/50 dark:border-borderMainDark/50 bg-transparent\">\n<table class=\"border-borderMain my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\">Parameter</th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\">Observation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Specimen Adequacy</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Adequate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Atrophy</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Absent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Repair</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Nil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Inflammation</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Moderate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Parabasal Cells</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Few</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Clue Cells</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Seen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Endometrial Cells</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Seen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Epithelial Cell Abnormalities</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Detected</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Squamous Cells Abnormalities</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Detected</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Glandular Cells Abnormalities</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Detected</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Trichomonas Vaginalis</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Seen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Fungal organisms</td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Seen</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-two bg-background border-border shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex gap-2 rounded-lg border py-px opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center min-w-0 font-medium gap-1 justify-center\">\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center size-3.5\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>IMPRESSION:</strong><br>SUGGESTIVE OF INFLAMMATORY SMEAR (NEGATIVE FOR INTRAEPITHELIAL LESION/MALIGNANCY)</p>\n<div class=\"relative\">\n<div class=\"prose text-pretty dark:prose-invert inline leading-normal break-words min-w-0 [word-break:break-word]\">\n<p class=\"my-0\">Certainly! Here is your provided text converted into a clean, copyable format:</p>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Note:</strong> Cervical cytology is a screening test and has associated false negative and false positive results. Regular sampling and follow up is recommended.<br><strong>Processing Method:</strong> Papanicolaou method</p>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><strong>Clinical Application:</strong></p>\n<ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">The smears are reported using the Bethesda System for Reporting Cervical Cytology (2014)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\">New Cervical Cancer Screening Recommendations from the U.S. Preventive Services Task Force and the American Cancer Society/American Society for Colposcopy and Cervical Pathology/American Society for Clinical Pathology. March 15, 2012, issue of Annals of Internal</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr class=\"bg-offsetPlus h-px border-0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
